(5915593, 862517, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nicely stopped!!  I think this would be great in black and white.  Then our eye would just focus on him and not be distracted by the orange and yellow shirts of the boys in the background. :)</td>', 'Nicely stopped!!  I think this would be great in black and white.  Then our eye would just focus on him and not be distracted by the orange and yellow shirts of the boys in the background. :)', '2010-03-24 08:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915595, 862615, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has that art/abstract feel.  I like the vivid contrasts.</td>', 'This has that art/abstract feel.  I like the vivid contrasts.', '2010-03-24 08:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915597, 861826, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wow!! I''ve never done well at stop action.  I probably don''t have my camera settings right. Nicely composed and focused. :)</td>', 'Wow!! I''ve never done well at stop action.  I probably don''t have my camera settings right. Nicely composed and focused. :)', '2010-03-24 08:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915598, 861891, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh I love the ''swoosh'' of the snow.  Nice use of diagonal line.</td>', 'Oh I love the ''swoosh'' of the snow.  Nice use of diagonal line.', '2010-03-24 08:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915599, 862301, 15711, '<td valign="top">How fun.  I love that those baby blues are tack sharp.  Is that a husky?  The colors remind me of my Summer.  I still miss her. I like how you have the dog placed in the shot.  The diagonal line of light and dark in the background is a nice touch. :)</td>', 'How fun.  I love that those baby blues are tack sharp.  Is that a husky?  The colors remind me of my Summer.  I still miss her. I like how you have the dog placed in the shot.  The diagonal line of light and dark in the background is a nice touch. :)', '2010-03-24 08:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915601, 862046, 15711, '<td valign="top">We used to call those shuttlecocks. This has commercial appeal. I can see it as an ad for some sport related product.  Probably the best I''ve seen so far.  I love the blue/green theme.</td>', 'We used to call those shuttlecocks. This has commercial appeal. I can see it as an ad for some sport related product.  Probably the best I''ve seen so far.  I love the blue/green theme.', '2010-03-24 08:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915605, 862366, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has an almost surreal sense.  I like it. :)</td>', 'This has an almost surreal sense.  I like it. :)', '2010-03-24 08:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915606, 862223, 15711, '<td valign="top">Like planets in the constellations!  Problem is, I don''t get the sense of stopped action.  They could have easily just been placed on a black background, although I know they are bouncing. :)</td>', 'Like planets in the constellations!  Problem is, I don''t get the sense of stopped action.  They could have easily just been placed on a black background, although I know they are bouncing. :)', '2010-03-24 08:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915610, 862468, 15711, '<td valign="top">I try not to like these overdone drops, but this is REALLY GOOD!!!</td>', 'I try not to like these overdone drops, but this is REALLY GOOD!!!', '2010-03-24 08:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915611, 862453, 15711, '<td valign="top">So many water droplets in this challenge, but I REALLY like this one.</td>', 'So many water droplets in this challenge, but I REALLY like this one.', '2010-03-24 08:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
