(5915791, 862334, 80912, '<td valign="top">What a shot! The texture on the pencil is what draws me first, but then you''ve got pencil-destruction bokeh! And the orange line on the border is (to me) the cherry on  top.</td>', 'What a shot! The texture on the pencil is what draws me first, but then you''ve got pencil-destruction bokeh! And the orange line on the border is (to me) the cherry on  top.', '2010-03-24 11:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
