(5915796, 862538, 80912, '<td valign="top">Great capture and lighting, but the crop is a bit tight. It makes it feel a bit cramped.</td>', 'Great capture and lighting, but the crop is a bit tight. It makes it feel a bit cramped.', '2010-03-24 11:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915798, 862198, 80912, '<td valign="top">The texture of the fur and the little droplets flying are what make this for me. The dog''s expression is what makes me look again.</td>', 'The texture of the fur and the little droplets flying are what make this for me. The dog''s expression is what makes me look again.', '2010-03-24 11:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915800, 862630, 80912, '<td valign="top">I hope the abstract nature of this doesn''t hurt your score. This is an awesome shot (in many ways). It reminds me of an ancient Japanese painting.</td>', 'I hope the abstract nature of this doesn''t hurt your score. This is an awesome shot (in many ways). It reminds me of an ancient Japanese painting.', '2010-03-24 11:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915802, 862302, 80912, '<td valign="top">Love the expression and the crop is perfect, but the colors seem a bit off (too blue?) and way too saturated for my taste.</td>', 'Love the expression and the crop is perfect, but the colors seem a bit off (too blue?) and way too saturated for my taste.', '2010-03-24 11:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915806, 862296, 80912, '<td valign="top">Fun capture (too bad you can''t use it for "Exit"!), but the colors are so subdued I can''t tell if you meant this to be in color or B&amp;W. Maybe a B&amp;W conversion would have had more impact?</td>', 'Fun capture (too bad you can''t use it for "Exit"!), but the colors are so subdued I can''t tell if you meant this to be in color or B&W. Maybe a B&W conversion would have had more impact?', '2010-03-24 11:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915807, 861654, 80912, '<td valign="top">A different version of water droplets? LOL I love the colors and the detail on the bird.</td>', 'A different version of water droplets? LOL I love the colors and the detail on the bird.', '2010-03-24 11:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915808, 862442, 80912, '<td valign="top">Looks like a giant cotton ball! (Unitl you see the yellow balloon)</td>', 'Looks like a giant cotton ball! (Unitl you see the yellow balloon)', '2010-03-24 11:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915810, 862162, 80912, '<td valign="top">What beautiful focus and lighting.</td>', 'What beautiful focus and lighting.', '2010-03-24 11:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915811, 861975, 80912, '<td valign="top">OK, where''d you hide the wire? But I''m still giving you an 8.</td>', 'OK, where''d you hide the wire? But I''m still giving you an 8.', '2010-03-24 11:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915813, 862598, 80912, '<td valign="top">I''d like to know more about this - did the child jump off the swing? or is that a second swing?<br/> <br/>Either way, the composition and texture is great.</td>', 'I''d like to know more about this - did the child jump off the swing? or is that a second swing? Either way, the composition and texture is great.', '2010-03-24 11:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915820, 861446, 70503, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. I love the DOF and the reflection and the clarity of the bird. Very well done.</td>', 'Very nice shot. I love the DOF and the reflection and the clarity of the bird. Very well done.', '2010-03-24 11:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915823, 861823, 70503, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I love the colors of the lighting.</td>', 'Great capture. I love the colors of the lighting.', '2010-03-24 11:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915827, 862595, 70503, '<td valign="top">She looks happy. A suggestion I have would be to crop it a bit tighter to lose most of the telephone pole wires.</td>', 'She looks happy. A suggestion I have would be to crop it a bit tighter to lose most of the telephone pole wires.', '2010-03-24 11:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915830, 862527, 70503, '<td valign="top">This is wicked cool. I don''t know that I would want to get that close to the match *smile*.. nice composition and colors.</td>', 'This is wicked cool. I don''t know that I would want to get that close to the match *smile*.. nice composition and colors.', '2010-03-24 11:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915834, 862675, 70503, '<td valign="top">I looked at this for a long time. It is really interesting to me. I love the composition and how it goes from dark to light. The droplets are mostly clear so it does give the impression of a stopped motion. Great job.</td>', 'I looked at this for a long time. It is really interesting to me. I love the composition and how it goes from dark to light. The droplets are mostly clear so it does give the impression of a stopped motion. Great job.', '2010-03-24 11:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915838, 861892, 70503, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t feel posed, but it doesn''t feel like stopped motion to me either. I like the black and white and the expression on the dude''s face.</td>', 'This doesn''t feel posed, but it doesn''t feel like stopped motion to me either. I like the black and white and the expression on the dude''s face.', '2010-03-24 11:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915840, 862296, 70503, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t want to get in their way. Nice capture. The water is a tad bit too blue-ish and seems unreal. Nice shot.</td>', 'Wouldn''t want to get in their way. Nice capture. The water is a tad bit too blue-ish and seems unreal. Nice shot.', '2010-03-24 11:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915844, 862292, 70503, '<td valign="top">HEY - why are you takin pictures of my teenager''s room? j/k <br/>I like the way it feels all discombobulated and like a stopped whirlwind. It feels a little too dark and some of the papers are pretty bright like the flash hit them hard.</td>', 'HEY - why are you takin pictures of my teenager''s room? j/k I like the way it feels all discombobulated and like a stopped whirlwind. It feels a little too dark and some of the papers are pretty bright like the flash hit them hard.', '2010-03-24 12:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915846, 862103, 70503, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty cool. I love the textures of the background and the composition. The action is definitely stopped. Great job!</td>', 'That''s pretty cool. I love the textures of the background and the composition. The action is definitely stopped. Great job!', '2010-03-24 12:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915848, 862142, 70503, '<td valign="top">Love the blue color and the feel of the stopped motion. Great capture.</td>', 'Love the blue color and the feel of the stopped motion. Great capture.', '2010-03-24 12:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915849, 862475, 70503, '<td valign="top">Looks like the sun was pretty hard to work with. Like the black and white and the action is definitely stopped.</td>', 'Looks like the sun was pretty hard to work with. Like the black and white and the action is definitely stopped.', '2010-03-24 12:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915858, 862452, 80912, '<td valign="top">Love the colors, the bright white bokeh, not so much.</td>', 'Love the colors, the bright white bokeh, not so much.', '2010-03-24 12:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915863, 862682, 70503, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition on this. My only problem with it is the bird isn''t in focus. Good luck!</td>', 'I really like the composition on this. My only problem with it is the bird isn''t in focus. Good luck!', '2010-03-24 12:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915865, 862047, 70503, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Love a lazy cat.</td>', 'Great capture. Love a lazy cat.', '2010-03-24 12:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
