(5916190, 862349, 5364, '<td valign="top">As you''ve effectively asked for comments, here''s mine:<br/> <br/>I''ve given you a 6 because I like this. You''ve captured a good moment in time; it''s in focus and exposed well and most importantly, it''s interesting. My only wonder is could you have captured this from a lower angle? and got your subject isolated against the sky instead of half in front of the background.<br/> <br/>I hope this is the sort of comment you were looking for.</td>', 'As you''ve effectively asked for comments, here''s mine: I''ve given you a 6 because I like this. You''ve captured a good moment in time; it''s in focus and exposed well and most importantly, it''s interesting. My only wonder is could you have captured this from a lower angle? and got your subject isolated against the sky instead of half in front of the background. I hope this is the sort of comment you were looking for.', '2010-03-24 15:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
