(5917015, 862009, 113419, '<td valign="top">this is a wonderful stop motion photo!  well done!  I like the background, the lighting and the shadows as well.</td>', 'this is a wonderful stop motion photo!  well done!  I like the background, the lighting and the shadows as well.', '2010-03-25 07:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917016, 861579, 113419, '<td valign="top">for this particular type of shot I think there is too much negative space there on the left side</td>', 'for this particular type of shot I think there is too much negative space there on the left side', '2010-03-25 07:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917018, 862318, 113419, '<td valign="top">I see your code!  imh I think you should have cropped a bit there on the left side to get that light spot out the top corner.  I''m not good with lighting so I don''t know how to correct this but those little reflections in the water are sort of distracting from your water drop.  However, I can see the strips in the indiviual drops and I like that.  Lots of work put forth in this photo - good job.</td>', 'I see your code!  imh I think you should have cropped a bit there on the left side to get that light spot out the top corner.  I''m not good with lighting so I don''t know how to correct this but those little reflections in the water are sort of distracting from your water drop.  However, I can see the strips in the indiviual drops and I like that.  Lots of work put forth in this photo - good job.', '2010-03-25 07:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917019, 861763, 113419, '<td valign="top">pretty model but this shot is just not doing it for me</td>', 'pretty model but this shot is just not doing it for me', '2010-03-25 07:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917020, 861719, 113419, '<td valign="top">wonderful work</td>', 'wonderful work', '2010-03-25 07:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
