(5917134, 862452, 111937, '<td valign="top">v nice !!!!</td>', 'v nice !!!!', '2010-03-25 11:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917186, 862265, 108580, '<td valign="top">ROFL. I''m guessing not your kid. Those knees and elbows were pretty red after this hehe. Nicely caught, facial expression great too.</td>', 'ROFL. I''m guessing not your kid. Those knees and elbows were pretty red after this hehe. Nicely caught, facial expression great too.', '2010-03-25 12:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917350, 862349, 115096, '<td valign="top">Cool shot :) My only critique is the kids shoe is touching the fence which slightly un-seperates him from the background... its a little distracting once you notice it.<br/>Not easy to have much of a choice on a shot like this though.</td>', 'Cool shot :) My only critique is the kids shoe is touching the fence which slightly un-seperates him from the background... its a little distracting once you notice it.Not easy to have much of a choice on a shot like this though.', '2010-03-25 15:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917378, 862611, 113591, '<td valign="top">The best for me is that sweet face, as if there are no water around his face.</td>', 'The best for me is that sweet face, as if there are no water around his face.', '2010-03-25 15:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917379, 861891, 113591, '<td valign="top">One of the best! What clinches it for me is the powdery inside leading to the chunky pieces on the outside, frozen(sic) in space! Wonderful!</td>', 'One of the best! What clinches it for me is the powdery inside leading to the chunky pieces on the outside, frozen(sic) in space! Wonderful!', '2010-03-25 15:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917380, 862366, 22556, '<td valign="top">Motion stopped???? nothing</td>', 'Motion stopped???? nothing', '2010-03-25 15:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917381, 861821, 22556, '<td valign="top">check the Challenge theme...not Emotion but MOTION</td>', 'check the Challenge theme...not Emotion but MOTION', '2010-03-25 15:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917383, 862563, 113591, '<td valign="top">Sharp! And the fact that the wings are still folded in enhances th e speed impression. Two birds in focus as well! Bumping up to max</td>', 'Sharp! And the fact that the wings are still folded in enhances th e speed impression. Two birds in focus as well! Bumping up to max', '2010-03-25 15:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917387, 862622, 113591, '<td valign="top">Another perfect image for the challenge. Bumping up</td>', 'Another perfect image for the challenge. Bumping up', '2010-03-25 15:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917388, 862157, 113591, '<td valign="top">Only if youhave tried to take this photo do you know how difficult it is. Well done!</td>', 'Only if youhave tried to take this photo do you know how difficult it is. Well done!', '2010-03-25 15:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917397, 862536, 113591, '<td valign="top">The flowing form of the bird shouts speed. And look at the afterburner working overtime!</td>', 'The flowing form of the bird shouts speed. And look at the afterburner working overtime!', '2010-03-25 15:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917400, 861886, 22556, '<td valign="top">noisy and grainy pics</td>', 'noisy and grainy pics', '2010-03-25 16:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917401, 862336, 113591, '<td valign="top">One of the more interesting bursting shots for me. I like the arrow already moving away from it''s target.</td>', 'One of the more interesting bursting shots for me. I like the arrow already moving away from it''s target.', '2010-03-25 16:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917402, 862452, 22556, '<td valign="top">This shot is my First Choice.. many water drops i saw but this one captured my eyes. Can u explain how did u do this</td>', 'This shot is my First Choice.. many water drops i saw but this one captured my eyes. Can u explain how did u do this', '2010-03-25 16:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917416, 862452, 113591, '<td valign="top">Cool. My eyes just want to wander around to look at all the colour permutations, but the are captured by the centre drop. Perfect background colour. Bumping up</td>', 'Cool. My eyes just want to wander around to look at all the colour permutations, but the are captured by the centre drop. Perfect background colour. Bumping up', '2010-03-25 16:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917418, 862021, 113591, '<td valign="top">It really looks like bird stickers pasted onto a photo. No, not in a bad way, in a perfect frozen bird way. I suppose it''s the B&amp;W that does it. Perfect!</td>', 'It really looks like bird stickers pasted onto a photo. No, not in a bad way, in a perfect frozen bird way. I suppose it''s the B&W that does it. Perfect!', '2010-03-25 16:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917419, 862440, 113591, '<td valign="top">Sharp focus, nice swirl of the powder. The hint of colour works well for me.</td>', 'Sharp focus, nice swirl of the powder. The hint of colour works well for me.', '2010-03-25 16:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917420, 862103, 113591, '<td valign="top">Even the grapes look like they were frozen n a fridge</td>', 'Even the grapes look like they were frozen n a fridge', '2010-03-25 16:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917425, 862318, 112828, '<td valign="top">Well done.  Without a doubt this meets the challenge.<br/> <br/>A couple of points:  I do not like the softness of the water, I suspect this is almost entirely due to aperture, it''s hard to balance this sort of thing, especially when you want all the light you can get.<br/> <br/>Other than that, I do wonder about your choice of background, either a higher angle, or a background that didn''t have a huge distracting black band..  Then again, I could see that particular feature being deliberate, as it does isolate the drop of water.</td>', 'Well done.  Without a doubt this meets the challenge. A couple of points:  I do not like the softness of the water, I suspect this is almost entirely due to aperture, it''s hard to balance this sort of thing, especially when you want all the light you can get. Other than that, I do wonder about your choice of background, either a higher angle, or a background that didn''t have a huge distracting black band..  Then again, I could see that particular feature being deliberate, as it does isolate the drop of water.', '2010-03-25 16:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917427, 862349, 112828, '<td valign="top">Looks like fun!<br/> <br/>A cool photo, but I think the composition is distracting, get lower and closer!<br/> <br/>Also, there does seem to be a bit of motion blur, and everything is just a tad soft.<br/> <br/>Still, super cool.</td>', 'Looks like fun! A cool photo, but I think the composition is distracting, get lower and closer! Also, there does seem to be a bit of motion blur, and everything is just a tad soft. Still, super cool.', '2010-03-25 16:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917437, 861539, 113591, '<td valign="top">Cropped quite a bit? Tells a nice story. I like the backgroun d - line of people.</td>', 'Cropped quite a bit? Tells a nice story. I like the backgroun d - line of people.', '2010-03-25 16:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917439, 862472, 113591, '<td valign="top">Stopped action everywhere you look.</td>', 'Stopped action everywhere you look.', '2010-03-25 16:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917441, 862654, 113591, '<td valign="top">The light''s angle gives the wings great shape. I''m no expert on sharpness, but the definition on the feathers looks good. Bumping up</td>', 'The light''s angle gives the wings great shape. I''m no expert on sharpness, but the definition on the feathers looks good. Bumping up', '2010-03-25 16:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917442, 861763, 5364, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit small and I can''t help thinking it would have worked better if the background was much darker, then her hair would have stood out more.</td>', 'It''s a bit small and I can''t help thinking it would have worked better if the background was much darker, then her hair would have stood out more.', '2010-03-25 16:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917444, 862433, 113591, '<td valign="top">The colours work really well together. Perhaps (nitpicking)a tighter crop to have stronger rule-of-thirds composition?</td>', 'The colours work really well together. Perhaps (nitpicking)a tighter crop to have stronger rule-of-thirds composition?', '2010-03-25 16:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917450, 862308, 113591, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Can''t see how you could have improved the shot.</td>', 'Nice composition. Can''t see how you could have improved the shot.', '2010-03-25 16:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917452, 862527, 113591, '<td valign="top">The flames really provides a nice background.</td>', 'The flames really provides a nice background.', '2010-03-25 16:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917453, 862615, 113591, '<td valign="top">These colour shots are allways striking. Well balanced, with the increase of the spilled liquid to the right</td>', 'These colour shots are allways striking. Well balanced, with the increase of the spilled liquid to the right', '2010-03-25 16:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917454, 862293, 113591, '<td valign="top">Did he catch the ball?</td>', 'Did he catch the ball?', '2010-03-25 16:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
