(5918992, 862318, 37845, '<td valign="top">This is a very nicely done water drop show, and I like the smooth blue tones and bokeh. The only unfortunate thing is that there are so many water drop shots in this challenge that it takes away all the uniqueness. <br/> <br/>Also, I would have cropped out the white in the top left. <br/> <br/>Overall a good shot. 6</td>', 'This is a very nicely done water drop show, and I like the smooth blue tones and bokeh. The only unfortunate thing is that there are so many water drop shots in this challenge that it takes away all the uniqueness.  Also, I would have cropped out the white in the top left.  Overall a good shot. 6', '2010-03-27 10:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918995, 862349, 37845, '<td valign="top">Good idea for a shot, and I love the title. The composition could be improved however... I wish there was more separation between him and the background, it looks like he is needing on the fence. Perhaps a different point of view, from lower on the ground, looking up at him into the sky, would provide that separation. <br/> <br/>Either way, a good shot overall. 6</td>', 'Good idea for a shot, and I love the title. The composition could be improved however... I wish there was more separation between him and the background, it looks like he is needing on the fence. Perhaps a different point of view, from lower on the ground, looking up at him into the sky, would provide that separation.  Either way, a good shot overall. 6', '2010-03-27 10:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
