(5920110, 862634, 70503, '<td valign="top">I like this capture, just wish it was a bit bigger so that the surfer was really in our face.</td>', 'I like this capture, just wish it was a bit bigger so that the surfer was really in our face.', '2010-03-28 19:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
