(5922999, 862334, 114969, '<td valign="top">Oh wow, I''m so thrilled with this result :-) Thank you all!<br/> <br/>I really didn''t think it would make so good, in fact I was really pessimistic when doing it. I had no good results after 130 tries, my fingers were hurting, and I was sleepy... decided to shoot some more just before going to bed, and this one appeared on the LCD screen!</td>', 'Oh wow, I''m so thrilled with this result :-) Thank you all! I really didn''t think it would make so good, in fact I was really pessimistic when doing it. I had no good results after 130 tries, my fingers were hurting, and I was sleepy... decided to shoot some more just before going to bed, and this one appeared on the LCD screen!', '2010-03-31 02:44:12.000000', NULL, 0),
