(5923804, 862640, 68586, '<td valign="top">5.06 ??  <br/> <br/>Love the picture and the two vignettes of different dogs with different owners. Waves crashing about in the background - Red setter staying still to get it''s leash on, Labrador (?) being about as well behaved as mine would be . .<br/> <br/>Walkies stopped, waves stopped, dogs stopped, people stopped . .  nope - can''t see anything  ''stopped '' here <br/> <br/> :- )<br/> <br/>A little ambivalent about the water in the foreground - maybe it adds - maybe it doesn''t. Otherwise really nice picture.</td>', '5.06 ??   Love the picture and the two vignettes of different dogs with different owners. Waves crashing about in the background - Red setter staying still to get it''s leash on, Labrador (?) being about as well behaved as mine would be . . Walkies stopped, waves stopped, dogs stopped, people stopped . .  nope - can''t see anything  ''stopped '' here   :- ) A little ambivalent about the water in the foreground - maybe it adds - maybe it doesn''t. Otherwise really nice picture.', '2010-03-31 17:19:24.000000', NULL, 0),
