(6237510, 862334, 114969, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by HighNooner:</b></div><hr/><i> What the speed of the shutter 5 seconds? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>The shutter speed was not important, all I wanted was it to be open when the flash blinked. So it was in bulb mode, and I kept it open about 5 seconds, while knocking the pen on the table.</td>', 'Originally posted by HighNooner: What the speed of the shutter 5 seconds?  The shutter speed was not important, all I wanted was it to be open when the flash blinked. So it was in bulb mode, and I kept it open about 5 seconds, while knocking the pen on the table.', '2010-11-29 14:26:23.000000', NULL, 0),
