(7239585, 861975, 117534, '<td valign="top">I have to add, in the photographic definitions, I tried to recreate this with a bullet coming from my gun to the screen, Just didn''t work as good as your outstanding shot... Some day I will get this awesome view recreated with the perfect balance of dof, light and action you did here.... Just thought I''d let you know You Inspired Me!!!</td>', 'I have to add, in the photographic definitions, I tried to recreate this with a bullet coming from my gun to the screen, Just didn''t work as good as your outstanding shot... Some day I will get this awesome view recreated with the perfect balance of dof, light and action you did here.... Just thought I''d let you know You Inspired Me!!!', '2014-07-10 14:56:19.000000', NULL, 0);
